# Context = ./apps/osionos/app (the osionos submodule). The AI service needs
# its own package files and sources, plus the ten bridge modules its
# sources import (see the header of ai.Dockerfile) and the lists the gate of
# the image prompt reads. Everything else is noise — and the node_modules of
# the app would be copied into the image otherwise.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
build
dist
test-results
playwright-report
docs
public
vendor
src
tests
# The scripts/ directory holds a hundred-odd modules; the service's closure is
# nine of them, and the gate of the image prompt a tenth. They are re-included
# one by one, so the closure is visible in both files
# (scripts/tests/bridge-image-closure.bats checks it).
scripts/*
!scripts/bridge-session-token.mjs
!scripts/bridge-session-cutoff.mjs
!scripts/bridge-baas-body.mjs
!scripts/bridge-session-revocations.mjs
!scripts/bridge-session-tracker.mjs
!scripts/bridge-roles.mjs
!scripts/bridge-page-read.mjs
!scripts/bridge-live-workspaces.mjs
!scripts/bridge-graph-edges.mjs
!scripts/bridge-moderation.mjs
# The lists of the L0 gate: the module reads them next to itself, at import.
!scripts/moderation-lists/
services/osionos-ai/tests
services/osionos-ai/node_modules
